__pycache__/
# make's output: the coverage profile, the test log, the template check's copier.
/build/
# Claude Code: only the shared settings, the guard and its config, the skills and
# the agents are tracked; the rest, among it the worktrees in .claude/worktrees/,
# stays out. Each exception names a child of .claude/ itself: git can't bring back
# a file whose directory is still left out. tests/test_gitignore.py holds it.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/guard.json
!.claude/hooks/
.claude/hooks/*
!.claude/hooks/guard.py
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/agents/
